            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="53" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:26,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:30,760</end-time>
                <translation>吉本在极为注重恩格斯的思想的同时</translation>
                <original>一方で吉本はですねエンゲルスをかなり強く意識しながら</original>
