            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="55" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:34,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:36,100</end-time>
                <translation>是这样的创作脉络</translation>
                <original>そういう流れになってますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="56" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:38,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:43,680</end-time>
                <translation>恩格斯参考当时人类学的知识这样想到</translation>
                <original>エンゲルスは当時の人類学の知見を参考に こう考えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="57" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:47,605</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:51,625</end-time>
                <translation>过去人类并非一夫一妻制
昔人間は一夫一婦制ではなく</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="58" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:51,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:56,900</end-time>
                <translation>而是采取群婚这一原始的婚姻形态
集団婚という原始的な婚姻形態を取っていました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="59" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:56,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:02,175</end-time>
                <translation>那是一种男女互相占有全体成员的婚姻形态
男女が互いに全員を所有し合う婚姻形態です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
