            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="60" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:02,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:06,045</end-time>
                <translation>在那个群体中 即使是父母、子女、兄弟姐妹之间
その集団では親子兄弟姉妹の間でも</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="61" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:06,045</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:08,380</end-time>
                <translation>也会发生性交</translation>
                <original>性交が行われており</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="62" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:08,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:11,900</end-time>
                <translation>没有近亲相奸这一概念</translation>
                <original>近親相姦という概念はありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="63" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:11,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:16,120</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来就不会产生嫉妒这种情感</translation>
                <original>そうすると嫉妬という感情が生じないので</original>
                <spell/>
