            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="64" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:16,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:21,425</end-time>
                <translation>因此集体生活得以顺利进行</translation>
                <original>集団生活は円滑に行われていました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="65" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:21,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:25,175</end-time>
                <translation>这一阶段之前的家族被称为母权制</translation>
                <original>この段階までの家族は母権制と呼ばれ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
