                <start-time>00:04:25,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:28,050</end-time>
                <translation>母方受到重视</translation>
                <original>母方が重視されています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="67" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:30,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:34,207</end-time>
                <translation>然而随着私有财产的产生</translation>
                <original>ところが私有財産の発生とともに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="68" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:34,207</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:36,900</end-time>
                <translation>发生了巨大的转变</translation>
                <original>大きな転換が生じます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="69" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:36,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:40,525</end-time>
                <translation>通过饲养家畜 私有财产不断增加
家畜の飼育によって私有財産が増え</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="70" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:40,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:43,775</end-time>
                <translation>资本主义的原型诞生了
資本主義の原型が誕生</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="71" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:04:43,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:46,552</end-time>
                <translation>不久家畜变成了货币</translation>
                <original>やがて家畜は貨幣となり</original>
