                <start-time>00:05:08,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:11,325</end-time>
                <translation>为了掩盖这种阶级对立</translation>
                <original>このような階級対立を隠蔽するために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="78" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:05:11,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:14,080</end-time>
                <translation>国家这一装置便诞生了</translation>
                <original>国家という装置が生まれた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="79" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:05:14,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:16,520</end-time>
                <translation>这便是恩格斯的想法</translation>
                <original>と考えたエンゲルス</original>
