                <end-time>00:05:48,125</end-time>
                <translation>便会成为共同幻想
共同幻想になり</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="86" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:05:48,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:51,225</end-time>
                <translation>他认为这与国家的诞生相关联</translation>
                <original>国家の誕生につながったと考えました</original>
