            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="90" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:06,960</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:11,100</end-time>
                <translation>这似乎是唯一确定的定义</translation>
                <original>唯一の確定的な定義であるように思える</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="91" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:13,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:18,325</end-time>
                <translation>因此 母权制社会的真正基础</translation>
                <original>それだから制社会の本当の基礎は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="92" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:18,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:21,150</end-time>
