            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="98" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:42,869</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:46,850</end-time>
                <translation>大家能够自由地以集体形式结成婚姻关系</translation>
                <original>みんなが自由に集団で婚姻関係を結べるということで</original>
                <spell/>
