                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="112" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:28,815</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:32,475</end-time>
                <translation>甚至会延伸到有钱人与没钱人之间的歧视</translation>
                <original>お金を持っている人と持っていない人の差別にまで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="113" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:32,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:34,454</end-time>
                <translation>在“空间上”扩展
空間的に広がって</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="114" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:34,454</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:37,775</end-time>
                <translation>然后为了掩盖这种差异（消解嫉妒）</translation>
                <original>そしてその差を見せなくするために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="115" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:37,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:40,493</end-time>
                <translation>就用国家这个盖子把它盖起来了</translation>
                <original>国家という蓋をしてしまうんのだっていうのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="116" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:40,493</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:42,510</end-time>
                <translation>这就是恩格斯的想法</translation>
                <original>エンゲルスの考え方なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="117" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:43,485</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:46,599</end-time>
                <translation>那么吉本隆明是怎么想的呢</translation>
                <original>で吉本隆明がどう考えたかというと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="118" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:46,599</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:50,600</end-time>
                <translation>用一句话来说 就是从来没有不存在嫉妒的社会</translation>
                <original>一言で言えば嫉妬のない社会なんかなかったんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="119" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:50,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:53,375</end-time>
                <translation>首先要从这里出发</translation>
                <original>というところからまずは出発することになるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="120" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:53,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:55,375</end-time>
                <translation>我也觉得嫉妒是存在的</translation>
                <original>嫉妬はあった気がしますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="121" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:55,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:57,175</end-time>
                <translation>本能上 无论何时</translation>
                <original>本能的にねいつでも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="122" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:57,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:59,612</end-time>
                <translation>嫉妒这种东西 无论何时</translation>
                <original>いつでも嫉妬なんて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="123" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:59,612</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:03,000</end-time>
                <translation>只要两个人聚在一起 嫉妒就会产生</translation>
                <original>二人人が寄ったら嫉妬は起こるんじゃないかという気がします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="124" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:03,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:05,080</end-time>
                <translation>完全如此</translation>
                <original>全くその通りであって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="125" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:05,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:08,025</end-time>
                <translation>吉本所思考的国家起源时注重的</translation>
                <original>吉本の考えた国家の始まりというのはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="126" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:08,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:12,040</end-time>
                <translation>反而是恩格斯想要排除掉的不需要的东西——</translation>
                <original>むしろエンゲルスがいらないものを排除したかった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="127" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:12,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:13,480</end-time>
                <translation>嫉妒这种感情</translation>
                <original>嫉妬という感情</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="128" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:13,593</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:15,675</end-time>
                <translation>正是这个</translation>
                <original>これにこれこそがですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="129" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:15,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:19,075</end-time>
                <translation>构成了国家形成的基础</translation>
                <original>国家の成り立ちの基本を成しているんだということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="130" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:19,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:20,975</end-time>
                <translation>在人际关系中</translation>
                <original>まあ人間関係にはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="131" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:20,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:22,560</end-time>
                <translation>只要两三个人聚在一起
二人三人集まれば</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="132" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:22,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:24,450</end-time>
                <translation>比如说议论那个人的闲话</translation>
                <original>例えばその人の噂をしたり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="133" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:24,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:27,160</end-time>
                <translation>或者受到那个人深刻的影响等等</translation>
                <original>あるいはその人から深い影響を受けたりというふうに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="134" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:27,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:28,650</end-time>
                <translation>我们的内心</translation>
                <original>心の中をですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="135" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:28,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:30,950</end-time>
                <translation>会被他人搅乱</translation>
                <original>僕たちは他人にかき乱されているんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="136" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:30,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:32,950</end-time>
                <translation>然后推拉着</translation>
                <original>そして押したり引いたりしているんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="137" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:32,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:35,260</end-time>
                <translation>这样的关系</translation>
                <original>そういった関係のことを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="138" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:35,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:37,250</end-time>
                <translation>与其说是嫉妒</translation>
                <original>まあ嫉妬というよりもですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="139" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:37,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:40,425</end-time>
                <translation>我更想把它称为爱欲式关系</translation>
                <original>これを私はエロス的関係というふうにですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="140" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:40,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:43,500</end-time>
                <translation>像这样称呼呢</translation>
                <original>呼びたいと思うんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="141" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:43,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:47,925</end-time>
                <translation>而且随着两个人的关系逐渐扩大</translation>
                <original>さらにですね二人の関係が徐々に広がってですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="142" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:47,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:50,050</end-time>
                <translation>血缘关系的兄弟姐妹
血縁関係の兄弟姉妹</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="143" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:50,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:52,200</end-time>
                <translation>会进一步扩大到村落社会</translation>
                <original>さらに広がって村社会というふうに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="144" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:52,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:54,980</end-time>
                <translation>在不断扩大的最终之处</translation>
                <original>拡大していった最終的なところに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="145" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:54,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:57,750</end-time>
                <translation>国家由此诞生</translation>
                <original>国家が生まれてくるというところから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="146" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:57,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:00,750</end-time>
                <translation>国家的本质是对幻想
国家の本質は対幻想</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="147" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:00,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:06,225</end-time>
                <translation>也即爱欲关系反而是国家的最初起源</translation>
                <original>さらに言えばですねエロス的関係が国家のむしろ最初なんだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="148" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:06,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:08,775</end-time>
                <translation>通过这种非理性的情感</translation>
                <original>そういう非合理的な感情によって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="149" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:08,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,600</end-time>
                <translation>我们构建着人际关系</translation>
                <original>僕たちは人間の関係性を作っている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="150" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:11,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:15,875</end-time>
                <translation>而国家则是其中最大的单位</translation>
                <original>そして国家というのはそれの最も大きな単位ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="151" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:15,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:21,200</end-time>
                <translation>对我们而言 它已成为关乎性、生与死的最大单位</translation>
                <original>我々にとって(性)生き->死にかかるの大きな単位になっているということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="152" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:21,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:24,850</end-time>
                <translation>此后 对幻想发展为共同
この後対幻想は共同幻想に発展していきます</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="153" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:24,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,050</end-time>
                <translation>吉本从《古事记》中天照与须佐之男的关系中解读了这一过程</translation>
                <original>その過程を吉本は古事記のアマテラスとスサノオの関係に読み解きました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="154" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:32,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:35,650</end-time>
                <translation>吉本在彻底研读《古事记》的过程中
吉本は古事記を徹底して読み込みながら</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="155" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:35,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,880</end-time>
                <translation>认为其中存在着对幻想的原型</translation>
                <original>そこに対幻想の原型があると考えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="156" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:41,655</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:47,250</end-time>
                <translation>伊邪那岐为去除污秽而进行禊祓时</translation>
                <original>イザナギが汚れを落とすためみそぎをすると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="157" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:47,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:50,400</end-time>
                <translation>众神由此诞生</translation>
                <original>そこから神々が生まれました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="158" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:50,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:53,700</end-time>
                <translation>洗左眼时 天照诞生</translation>
                <original>左の目を洗った時にアマテラスが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="159" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:53,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:56,750</end-time>
                <translation>洗右眼时 月读诞生</translation>
                <original>右の目を洗った時にツクヨミが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="160" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:56,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:59,700</end-time>
                <translation>洗鼻子时 须佐之男诞生</translation>
                <original>鼻を洗った時スサノオが生まれます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="161" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:01,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:04,625</end-time>
                <translation>天照受命统治高天原</translation>
                <original>アマテラスにはタカマガハラを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="162" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:04,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:07,575</end-time>
                <translation>月读受命统治夜之世界</translation>
                <original>スクヨミには夜の世界を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="163" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:08,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:11,325</end-time>
                <translation>须佐之男受命统治大海</translation>
                <original>スサノオには海原を統治するよう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="164" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:11,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:13,700</end-time>
                <translation>伊邪那岐分别向他们下达了命令</translation>
                <original>それぞれに申し渡しますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="165" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:16,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:20,400</end-time>
                <translation>但只有须佐之男不服从伊邪那岐的命令 哭闹不止</translation>
                <original>スサノオだけはイザナギの命に従わず泣き喚くので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="166" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:20,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:22,600</end-time>
                <translation>恶灵因此骚动
悪霊が騒ぎ立て</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="167" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:22,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:27,175</end-time>
                <translation>各种灾祸随之发生</translation>
                <original>あらゆる災いが発生します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="168" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:27,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:30,450</end-time>
                <translation>“为何不治理大海而一味哭泣？”</translation>
                <original>なぜ海を統治せず泣いてばかりいるのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="169" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:30,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:33,800</end-time>
                <translation>伊邪那岐质问道</translation>
                <original>とイザナギが問いただすと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="170" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:33,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:37,150</end-time>
                <translation>我想去亡母所在的根之坚洲国</translation>
                <original>亡き母のいる根のかたすのくにへ行きたい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="171" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:38,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:42,600</end-time>
                <translation>既然如此 你便不能再住在这个国家</translation>
                <original>そうであるならばもうこの国に住むことはならぬ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="172" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:42,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:43,900</end-time>
                <translation>滚出去</translation>
                <original>でていけ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="173" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:46,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:48,900</end-time>
                <translation>被父亲伊邪那岐驱逐的须佐之男</translation>
                <original>父イザナギから追いやられたスサノオは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="174" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:48,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:51,720</end-time>
                <translation>向姐姐天照告别</translation>
                <original>姉のアマテラスに別れを告げようと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="175" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:53,270</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:58,075</end-time>
                <translation>他飞上天空 直奔高天原</translation>
                <original>空に駆け飛びタカマガハラを目指します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="176" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:58,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:02,725</end-time>
                <translation>其势凶猛 山川轰鸣</translation>
                <original>その様は荒々しく山や川はどよめき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="177" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:02,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:07,050</end-time>
                <translation>大地几乎全部震动</translation>
                <original>土はことごとく揺れるほどでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="178" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:07,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:10,450</end-time>
                <translation>听到那声音而惊恐的天照</translation>
                <original>その音を聞いて驚き恐れたアマテラスは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="179" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:10,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:12,875</end-time>
                <translation>我弟弟前来</translation>
                <original>我が弟がやってくるのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="180" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:12,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:16,875</end-time>
                <translation>一定是想夺取高天原</translation>
                <original>タカマガハラを奪おうと思っているからに違いないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="181" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:16,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:20,425</end-time>
                <translation>于是做好战斗准备严阵以待</translation>
                <original>戦の準備をして待ち構えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="182" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:20,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:22,560</end-time>
                <translation>你为何而来</translation>
                <original>いかなるわけで登ってきたのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="183" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:24,410</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:28,675</end-time>
                <translation>姐姐 我只是来告别的</translation>
                <original>姉上私はただお別れを言いに来ただけなのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="184" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:28,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:31,550</end-time>
                <translation>并无邪念</translation>
                <original>邪な心などありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="185" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:31,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:35,250</end-time>
                <translation>如何证明你没有邪念</translation>
                <original>邪心がないことをどう証明する</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="186" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:35,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:38,400</end-time>
                <translation>那么让我们向神立誓吧</translation>
                <original>それでは神に誓約＜うけい＞をいたしましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="187" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:39,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:44,675</end-time>
                <translation>所谓誓约 就是用彼此佩戴之物来占卜吉凶</translation>
                <original>誓約とはお互い身につけているものから幸運で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="188" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:44,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:48,740</end-time>
                <translation>以此来判断正邪</translation>
                <original>それで正邪を図ろうというものでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="189" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:48,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:53,350</end-time>
                <translation>就这样 两人之间进行了类似性行为的仪式
こうして二人の間で疑似的な性行為が行われ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="190" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:53,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:55,000</end-time>
                <translation>对幻想由此诞生</translation>
                <original>対幻想が生まれます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="191" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:58,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:02,725</end-time>
                <translation>通过誓约 众神诞生、国家诞生的景象</translation>
                <original>誓約によって神々が生まれ国が生まれる様は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="192" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:02,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:07,275</end-time>
                <translation>表现了共同体扩大、国家诞生的过程
共同体が拡大して国家が誕生する過程を表しています</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="193" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:09,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:13,275</end-time>
                <translation>吉本认为 这样在两人之间产生的对幻想</translation>
                <original>このようにして二人の間で生まれた対幻想が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="194" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:13,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:17,740</end-time>
                <translation>会扩大为共同幻想</translation>
                <original>共同幻想へと拡大していくと吉本は考えたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="195" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:21,765</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:27,800</end-time>
                <translation>不过 原始母权制社会的本质并不在于群婚
ただ原始的母権制社会の本質が集団婚にあるのではなく</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="196" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:27,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:31,850</end-time>
                <translation>而在于兄弟姐妹之间的“对幻想”
兄弟と姉妹の間の＜対なる幻想＞が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="197" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:31,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:36,500</end-time>
                <translation>与部族的“共同幻想”相一致</translation>
                <original>種族の＜共同幻想＞に同致するところにあり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="198" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:36,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:39,000</end-time>
                <translation>而媒介这种一致的</translation>
                <original>この同致を媒介するものは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="199" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:39,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:44,800</end-time>
                <translation>是意味着共同规范 这一点很重要</translation>
                <original>共同的な規範を意味する的祭儀行為だということが大切なのだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="200" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:47,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:49,980</end-time>
                <translation>这个节目很久以前做过《古事记》</translation>
                <original>この番組でずいぶん前に古事記やったんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="201" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:49,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:52,060</end-time>
                <translation>和那时的解读方式又有些不同</translation>
                <original>その時の読み方とはまたちょっと違う</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="202" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:52,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:54,025</end-time>
                <translation>和这次吉本的解读不同</translation>
                <original>やっぱり吉本の読み方は違うんで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="203" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:54,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:56,820</end-time>
                <translation>这里是吉本流的解释方式</translation>
                <original>吉本流の解釈の仕方はこういうこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="204" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:56,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:58,725</end-time>
                <translation>不过相当晦涩难懂啊</translation>
                <original>ただかなり難解ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="205" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:58,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:01,275</end-time>
                <translation>天照和须佐之男</translation>
                <original>アマテラスとスサノーというですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="206" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:01,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:04,275</end-time>
                <translation>是兄弟姐妹的关系
兄弟姉妹の関係がですね</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="207" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:04,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:07,887</end-time>
                <translation>这里的关键在于“国生”</translation>
                <original>ここでポイントになるのは国生みというふうに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="208" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:07,887</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:09,475</end-time>
                <translation>也就是生育国土</translation>
                <original>国を生むというですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="209" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:09,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:12,700</end-time>
                <translation>讲述的是一种模拟的性关系</translation>
                <original>擬似性的な関係の話をしているわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="210" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:12,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:15,700</end-time>
                <translation>而且 此时所进行的是</translation>
                <original>しかもその際に何を行うかというとまあ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="211" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:15,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:19,725</end-time>
                <translation>一种名为“誓约（受入）”祭祀式行为</translation>
                <original>誓约というある祭儀的な行為をする</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="212" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:19,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:23,150</end-time>
                <translation>请大家看这边</translation>
                <original>こちらの方を見ていただきたいんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="213" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:23,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:26,175</end-time>
                <translation>首先 以一对一的男女关系为基础
まず1対1の男女関係を基礎にした</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="214" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:26,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:29,175</end-time>
                <translation>存在着所谓的“对幻想”</translation>
                <original>対幻想というのがあるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="215" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:29,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:33,500</end-time>
                <translation>这种对幻想扩展到家族、血缘关系
この対幻想が家族とか血縁関係に広がって</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="216" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:33,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:37,550</end-time>
                <translation>通过分家等方式在村落中不断扩大</translation>
                <original>まあ村に分家したりすることで拡大していく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="217" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:37,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:41,540</end-time>
                <translation>而当它上升到国家层面时</translation>
                <original>それがですね国家に上がっていく際にはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="218" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:41,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:44,325</end-time>
                <translation>因为会有血缘关系以外的人加入</translation>
                <original>血縁関係以外の人も入ってきますから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="219" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:44,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:49,500</end-time>
                <translation>吉本认为必然会产生裂痕和断绝</translation>
                <original>必ず亀裂や断絶があるのだというふうに吉本は言っているわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="220" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:49,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:54,900</end-time>
                <translation>那么 这些人如何构建共同性呢</translation>
                <original>じゃあその人たちがどうやって共同性を作っていくのかといいますと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="221" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:54,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:58,500</end-time>
                <translation>掌管这种共同幻想的</translation>
                <original>その共同の幻想を司っているのがですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="222" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:58,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:03,500</end-time>
                <translation>例如誓约等祭仪、祭祀活动</translation>
                <original>例えば誓であるとかの祭儀お祭りになるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="223" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:03,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:07,600</end-time>
                <translation>举行规定的仪式就 一定会丰收</translation>
                <original>こういった儀式をすると必ず豊作になるのだというのを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="224" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:07,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:10,025</end-time>
                <translation>每年都会有确认这一点的祭祀活动</translation>
                <original>毎年確認するお祭りがあったり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="225" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:10,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:14,040</end-time>
                <translation>或是以规定的形式祈祷之后再进山</translation>
                <original>こういった形でお祈りをしてから山の中に入ると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="226" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:14,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:17,075</end-time>
                <translation>就一定能猎到很多野猪</translation>
                <original>必ずイノシシがたくさん獲れるんだとかですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="227" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:17,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:20,250</end-time>
                <translation>通过举行这种形式的祭仪</translation>
                <original>そういう形の祭儀を行うことで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="228" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:20,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:23,980</end-time>
                <translation>通过共享这些 村落的秩序得以成立</translation>
                <original>それを共有することで村の秩序が成り立っていく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="229" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:23,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:26,525</end-time>
                <translation>幻想得以成立</translation>
                <original>幻想が成り立っていくということです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="230" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:26,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:31,175</end-time>
                <translation>而当国家规模变得更大一些时</translation>
                <original>そしてもう少し大きな国家になってくるとですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="231" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:31,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:34,050</end-time>
                <translation>就出现了巫女这一存在</translation>
                <original>巫女という存在が出てきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="232" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:34,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:36,760</end-time>
                <translation>所谓巫女是怎样的存在呢</translation>
                <original>この巫女というのはどういう存在かというと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="233" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:36,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:42,350</end-time>
                <translation>吉本认为 在有共同性的村落间所抱有的幻想</translation>
                <original>吉本によれば共同の村などで抱いている幻想と</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="234" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:42,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:47,425</end-time>
                <translation>以及能让他们缔结性关系的存在就是巫女</translation>
                <original>性的な関係を結べる存在が巫女なのだというふうに言ってますから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="235" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:47,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:52,525</end-time>
                <translation>巫女举行神事祭事</translation>
                <original>巫女さんがある神事祭事を行うということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="236" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:52,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:53,825</end-time>
                <translation>就是将共同体的</translation>
                <original>とりも直さず共同体の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="237" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:55,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:59,225</end-time>
                <translation>村落的那些不能做的规则和戒律</translation>
                <original>村なら村のやってはいけないルールとか掟</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="238" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:59,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:04,675</end-time>
                <translation>由巫女亲口向社会宣告</translation>
                <original>それを巫女さんが社会に対して自分の口から言うわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="239" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:04,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:09,000</end-time>
                <translation>由此整个社会得以凝聚</translation>
                <original>そのことによって社会全体がまとまっていくんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="240" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:09,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:14,175</end-time>
                <translation>进而构建起国家这种普通人之间的联系</translation>
                <original>それでそれは国家という一般の人同士の繋がりを作っていくんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="241" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:14,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:17,800</end-time>
                <translation>而这又像是在进行复杂的传接球</translation>
                <original>でまたこれが複雑なキャッチボールをしていく感じで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="242" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:17,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:21,425</end-time>
                <translation>将大家共同形成的幻想</translation>
                <original>そのみんなの共同幻想になったやつを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="243" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:21,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:23,325</end-time>
                <translation>再次通过巫女这一媒介</translation>
                <original>もう一回その巫女というのを通すと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="244" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:23,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:26,240</end-time>
                <translation>-就能还原为对幻想的形式 -是的</translation>
                <original>-対幻想の形に戻せたりとか　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="245" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:26,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:29,180</end-time>
                <translation>而控制这位巫女</translation>
                <original>でこの巫女というのをコントロールする</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="246" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:29,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:34,900</end-time>
                <translation>只要巫女和某个幕后之人能够充分共享对幻想</translation>
                <original>まあ巫女と誰か黒幕がちゃんと対幻想を共有できれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="247" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:34,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:37,536</end-time>
                <translation>就会发生巫女说了 所以要提高年贡</translation>
                <original>巫女が言ったから年貢をあげる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="248" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:37,536</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:39,800</end-time>
                <translation>- 之类的事情也完全可以做到 - 是的</translation>
                <original>-みたいなことも全然できるわけですよね　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="249" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:39,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:42,240</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来就变得很像国家了</translation>
                <original>そうやっていくととても国っぽくなってきますよねこの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="250" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:42,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:44,175</end-time>
                <translation>是的 一下子就</translation>
                <original>そうですね一気に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="251" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:44,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:45,520</end-time>
                <translation>那么接下来</translation>
                <original>さあでは続いて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="252" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:45,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:47,780</end-time>
                <translation>我们来看看吉本在《共同幻想论》中
吉本が共同幻想論の中で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="253" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:47,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:50,610</end-time>
                <translation>是如何解读《远野物语》的</translation>
                <original>遠野の物語をどう読み解いたのか見ていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="254" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:54,810</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:58,000</end-time>
                <translation>在远野镇上 有一位被称为鸟御前的
遠野の町に鳥御前と呼ばれる</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="255" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:58,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:01,800</end-time>
                <translation>对山非常熟悉的鹰匠</translation>
                <original>山に大層詳しい鷹匠がおりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="256" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:04,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:09,180</end-time>
                <translation>有一天 鸟御前为了采蘑菇进入山中</translation>
                <original>ある日鳥御前がキノコを取るために山に入ると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="257" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:12,905</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:16,560</end-time>
                <translation>遇到了一对红脸男女正在交谈</translation>
                <original>赤い顔をした男女が話をしているのに出くわします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="258" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:20,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:25,150</end-time>
                <translation>两人看到鸟御前 便张开手制止他</translation>
                <original>二人は鳥御前を見ると手を広げて静止しますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="259" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:25,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:29,975</end-time>
                <translation>但鸟御前毫不在意 想要继续前行</translation>
                <original>鳥御前は構わず行こうとしました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="260" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:29,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:32,157</end-time>
                <translation>从他们的姿态和举止来看</translation>
                <original>その姿振る舞いから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="261" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:32,157</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:35,175</end-time>
                <translation>看来这些家伙或许不是人类</translation>
                <original>どうやら奴らは人間ではないのでは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="262" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:35,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:40,075</end-time>
                <translation>鸟御前心生疑虑 便向二人砍去</translation>
                <original>と怪しみ鳥御前は二人に切りかかりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="263" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:45,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:47,925</end-time>
                <translation>然而反被男子踢中</translation>
                <original>しかし逆に男に蹴られて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="264" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:47,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:50,850</end-time>
                <translation>坠入谷底</translation>
                <original>谷底に落ちてしまい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="265" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:50,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:54,875</end-time>
                <translation>在昏迷之际被熟人救起照料</translation>
                <original>気を失っているところを知り合いに介抱されて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="266" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:54,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:58,225</end-time>
                <translation>总算回到了家中</translation>
                <original>なんとか家に戻ります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="267" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:58,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:01,270</end-time>
                <translation>自己或许会因此而死</translation>
                <original>自分はこのために死ぬかもしれない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="268" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:03,345</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:10,275</end-time>
                <translation>而鸟御前在三天后真的死去了</translation>
                <original>そうして鳥御前は三日後に本当に死んでしまいました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="269" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:10,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:14,025</end-time>
                <translation>家人向山伏咨询此事</translation>
                <original>家族が山伏にこのことを相談すると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="270" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:14,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:17,340</end-time>
                <translation>被告知是因为打扰了山神游玩</translation>
                <original>山の神が遊んでいるのを邪魔したことによる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="271" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:17,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:19,175</end-time>
                <translation>而招致的作祟</translation>
                <original>祟りだと告げられます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="272" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:22,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:27,675</end-time>
                <translation>总之 鸟御前是被幻觉引诱而失足</translation>
                <original>要するに鳥御前は幻覚に誘われて足を踏み滑らし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="273" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:27,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:31,500</end-time>
                <translation>坠入谷底昏迷 又因摔伤位置不好</translation>
                <original>谷底に落ちて気絶し打ち所が悪かったので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="274" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:31,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:34,475</end-time>
                <translation>在三天后死去了 仅此而已</translation>
                <original>三日ほどして死んだというだけだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="275" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:34,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:40,075</end-time>
                <translation>然而 鸟御前并非单纯在生理意义上</translation>
                <original>けれど鳥御前が単に生理的にではなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="276" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:40,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:42,800</end-time>
                <translation>而是要让人能接受他在综合意义上死去</translation>
                <original>いわば総合的に死ぬためには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="277" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:42,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:47,040</end-time>
                <translation>就必须将他自己人为制造出的幻想</translation>
                <original>ぜひとも自分が作為して作り上げた幻想を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="278" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:47,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:49,925</end-time>
                <translation>如同共同幻想一般</translation>
                <original>共同幻想であるかのように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="279" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:49,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:54,400</end-time>
                <translation>纳入群体内部</translation>
                <original>内部に繰り込むことが必要なはずだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="280" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:54,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:57,850</end-time>
                <translation>换言之 被山人踢中这件事</translation>
                <original>言い換えれば山人に蹴られたことが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="281" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:17:57,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:00,320</end-time>
                <translation>大概是将把他逼向死亡的原因</translation>
                <original>自分を死に追い込むはずだという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="282" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:00,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:05,350</end-time>
                <translation>集体必须制造出这样的强迫观念</translation>
                <original>強迫観念を作り出さねばならなかったはずだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="283" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:05,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:12,000</end-time>
                <translation>而在这种情况下 出现在鸟御前幻觉中的红脸男女
そしてこの場合鳥御前の幻覚に現れた赤ら顔の男女は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="284" time="" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:12,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:15,300</end-time>
                <translation>正是共同幻想的表象</translation>
                <original>共同幻想の表象に他ならないのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="285" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:19,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:26,225</end-time>
                <translation>死亡同样发挥着将共同体联结在一起的作用</translation>
                <original>死もまた共同体を一つにつなぐ働きをしている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="286" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:26,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:29,380</end-time>
                <translation>吉本通过对《远野物语》的分析
吉本は遠野物語の分析によって</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="287" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:29,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:34,520</end-time>
                <translation>阐述了死亡在共同幻想起源中所扮演的角色</translation>
                <original>死というものが共同幻想の起源に果たす役割を説きました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="288" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:38,870</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:42,050</end-time>
                <translation>我因为这个节目而喜欢上了《远野物语》</translation>
                <original>僕は遠野物語がこの番組きっかけで好きなので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="289" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:42,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:45,360</end-time>
                <translation>一边想着原来还有这样的解读方式</translation>
                <original>こういう読み解き方があるんだと思いながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="290" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:45,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:47,325</end-time>
                <translation>深感佩服</translation>
                <original>ちょっと感心してます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="291" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:47,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:49,260</end-time>
                <translation>那么 鸟御前的死</translation>
                <original>ですから鳥御前の死は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="292" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:49,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:52,960</end-time>
                <translation>可以说是因共同幻想而死的吗？先崎老师</translation>
                <original>共同幻想による死だということになるんでしょうか　先崎さん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="293" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:52,960</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:57,260</end-time>
                <translation>是的 关键在于恐惧这种情感</translation>
                <original>そうですねポイントは恐れという感情を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="294" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:57,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:01,650</end-time>
                <translation>由共同体所共享这一点非常重要</translation>
                <original>共同体が共有しているということが非常に大事であって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="295" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:01,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:05,400</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来 反过来即使实际上并非致命伤</translation>
                <original>そうすると逆に実際は致命傷じゃないような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="296" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:05,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:07,550</end-time>
                <translation>只是擦伤而已</translation>
                <original>かすり傷であったとしても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="297" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:07,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:11,800</end-time>
                <translation>在共享这种共同幻想的社会中</translation>
                <original>その共同幻想を共有している社会においては</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="298" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:11,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:14,553</end-time>
                <translation>他实际上也会因此衰弱而死</translation>
                <original>実はですね衰弱して亡くなっていく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="299" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:14,553</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:17,575</end-time>
                <translation>这种情况是存在的</translation>
                <original>なんていうことがあるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="300" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:17,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:20,500</end-time>
                <translation>哎呀 这一点非常有趣</translation>
                <original>いやーこことても興味深くて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="301" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:20,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:21,950</end-time>
                <translation>从积极的一面来说</translation>
                <original>プラスの方でいくとね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="302" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:21,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:23,925</end-time>
                <translation>可以说是圆满地死去吗</translation>
                <original>円満に死ぬっていうのかな</original>
