            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="332" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:59,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:02,225</end-time>
                <translation>那么为什么它会变成这样的故事呢</translation>
                <original>なぜじゃあそれがこの物語になってるかっていうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="333" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:02,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:04,250</end-time>
                <translation>就是这么一回事</translation>
                <original>こういうことだっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="334" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:04,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:05,550</end-time>
                <translation>是啊</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="335" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:08,467</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:11,475</end-time>
                <translation>对吉本而言的“国家的起源”
吉本にとっての「国家の起源」</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="336" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:12,245</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:16,850</end-time>
                <translation>无论如何 吉本隆明对国家的印象</translation>
                <original>いずれにしても吉本隆明の国家に対するイメージというのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="337" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:16,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:21,500</end-time>
                <translation>是非常重视国家中的情感的</translation>
                <original>非常にですね国家というのを感情を重視してですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="338" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:21,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:27,100</end-time>
                <translation>他认为非合理的东西才是出发点 这一点很重要</translation>
                <original>非合理なものが出発点なんだっていうふうに考えたというのは大事なことだと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="339" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:27,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:29,621</end-time>
                <translation>例如嫉妒和好恶的情感
例えば嫉妬や好悪の感情</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="340" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:29,621</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:32,060</end-time>
                <translation>尊敬和厌恶的情感</translation>
                <original>尊敬や嫌悪の感情ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="341" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:32,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:34,850</end-time>
                <translation>他在这些东西中找到了国家的起源</translation>
                <original>そういうものに国家の起源を見出しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="342" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:34,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:36,450</end-time>
                <translation>如果不是这样的话</translation>
                <original>そうでないとですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="343" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:36,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:38,580</end-time>
                <translation>例如 人为什么会</translation>
                <original>例えばなぜ人がですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="344" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:38,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:40,300</end-time>
                <translation>对国家表现出那样</translation>
                <original>国家に対してあれだけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="345" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:40,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:43,925</end-time>
                <translation>时而肯定时而否定</translation>
                <original>肯定的になったりとか否定的になったりとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="346" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:43,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:46,925</end-time>
                <translation>为什么会被情感如此动摇</translation>
                <original>そういうふうに感情を揺さぶられるのかということをですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="347" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:46,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:51,425</end-time>
                <translation>吉本认为 如果不这样 就无法很好地解释这一点</translation>
                <original>うまく説明できないんじゃないかっていうのが吉本にはあったんだと思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="348" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:51,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:53,775</end-time>
                <translation>但明白了这一点之后</translation>
                <original>でもこのことが分かると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="349" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:53,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:55,720</end-time>
                <translation>最近在网上经常能看到</translation>
                <original>最近ネットなんかでよくね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="350" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:55,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:59,825</end-time>
                <translation>那些思想极端的人互相谩骂对吧</translation>
                <original>その極端な思想の人同士が罵り合うじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="351" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:59,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:02,920</end-time>
                <translation>那时 用吉本式的思考方式</translation>
                <original>でその時に吉本的な考え方で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" hasRuby="0" index="352" time="" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:02,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:05,850</end-time>
                <translation>要不要稍微停下来想一想呢</translation>
                <original>ちょっと立ち止まって考えてみませんかっていう</original>
